 "description": "The full picture of one client in YOUR agency's CRM: contact details,\nwhere they sit on the pipeline boards, the agents they belong to,\ntheir saved searches, their enquiries, recent notes and history,\nviewings with outcomes, listings already sent to them, when they\nwere last in touch and what is booked next.\n\nGet the contact_id from find_contacts or my_pipeline first. Use\nthis before advising an agent on a client, and before\nmatch_buyer_to_inventory, so you know what has already been sent.\n\nRequires a linked PropertyList account (or an agency API key); only ever reads the calling\nagency's own contacts, and only those the caller may see in the CRM.\n",
 "inputSchema": {
  "properties": {
   "contact_id": {
    "description": "The contact id, from find_contacts or my_pipeline.",
    "type": "integer"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "contact_id"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
